"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2023-01-03T17:02:44Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T21:27:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Explain the problem.**\r\n\r\nRender the following markdown with `pandoc/core Input.md --self-contained --toc --output=Output.html`.\r\n\r\n```md\r\n# Heading with subheading in individual fenced divs (good)\r\n\r\n::: Fenced1\r\n\r\n## A1\r\n\r\nContent of a1.\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: Fenced2\r\n\r\n## A2\r\n\r\nContent of a2.\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n# Heading with subheading in same fenced div (bad)\r\n\r\n::: Fenced3\r\n\r\n## B1\r\n\r\nContent of b1.\r\n\r\n\r\n## B2\r\n\r\nContent of b2.\r\n\r\n:::\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/388796/210404629-f68b1187-09aa-44a5-9c8f-8d165c56df5e.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nSo it seams that when a fenced div contains more than one subheading the contained subheadings aren't rendered in the TOC.\r\n\r\n**Pandoc version?**\r\n\r\n```text\r\npandoc 2.19.2\r\nCompiled with pandoc-types 1.22.2.1, texmath 0.12.5.2, skylighting 0.13,\r\nciteproc 0.8.0.1, ipynb 0.2, hslua 2.1.0\r\nScripting engine: Lua 5.3\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jgm/pandoc/issues/8518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jgm/pandoc/issues/8518/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}